# Same whitelist as .gitignore, so a manual `vercel deploy` from this folder uploads
# only the landing page and each week's code, never the readings or the syllabus.
# (No trailing slashes: Vercel's matcher needs them omitted for the re-includes to work.)
/*
!/index.html
!/vercel.json
!/week-*
/week-*/*
!/week-*/code
*.py
